{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>And the altar round about and its cords.</b> Why did the verse not mention here the pegs and the hangings of the court?" "<b>And all their service-items.</b> As its Targum renders; and similarly, 'and all that was done there, he did' (i.e., the form יעשה as a noun)."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {1 "Chizkuni reads להם ועבדו as two words: להם = 'for them', ועבדו = 'and their service/items'; the comparison to ואת כל אשר היו עושים שם הוא היה עושה supports taking יעשה as a verbal noun of service-objects."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:16:30.487534780Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}